les in which each unit's position and abilities matter.\n\nEach region brings tougher enemies and bigger rewards, with powerful bosses and a new race of Lizards among the foes. The game continues from the earlier King's Bounty: The Legend with deeper tactics, so it suits fans of turn-based strategy and role-playing who like planning army builds and adapting to new threats. It is single-player."}}